# Batch scripts run under cmd.exe in the Windows VM and must have CRLF line
# endings: with LF, cmd mis-parses labels and `goto`/`call` targets, and a
# fresh install jumped into the wrong loop. `-text` stores the bytes as they
# are, so no checkout, archive or editor setting converts them, and `make lint`
# refuses a .bat or .cmd with any LF-only line. A CR before the newline is not
# trailing whitespace for `git diff --check`.
*.bat -text diff whitespace=cr-at-eol
*.cmd -text diff whitespace=cr-at-eol
